  lines:
  - npcType: 6
    dialogueText: The pieces are slowly coming together.
  - npcType: 6
    dialogueText: I feel I can end this. One way or another.
  - npcType: 6
    dialogueText: Wait... something feels heavy in my pocket.
  - npcType: 6
    dialogueText: A memory key...
  - npcType: 6
    dialogueText: I should be able to unlock another memory with it.
